1. Application commands
open chrome
open whatsapp
open netflix
open calculator
open terminal
open vscode

close chrome
close whatsapp
close netflix

restart chrome

Patterns:

open <application>
launch <application>
start <application>

close <application>
exit <application>
stop <application>
